MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Aur_m01_001: Cai, thank you! I'm so grateful for your help.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Aur_m01_002: You've helped me understand a lot of what it is that\nI want to do.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Aur_m01_003: To think that my little boy has grown up so well...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Aur_m01_004: Now I need to find a way to properly explain myself\nand my desires for the future to my father.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c12_Aur_m01: <BLN>Thank you!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01_001: I want to ask your mom so many things about her\ntime with your dad!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01_002: I'd never have imagined a god and a mortal could\ntruly fall in love.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01_003: It's so beautiful! It makes my heart go boom, hehe.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01_004: But I imagine Centurio would get upset with me if\nI bothered her with too many questions...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01_005: Not to mention it'd feel weird asking her about those\ndays with you standing right there.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01_006: It's unbearable not being able to ask everything that\nI want to!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c12_Tia_m01: <BLN>I have so many questions...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_001: Hey, Cai, how are you feeling with the final\ncoming up?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_002: <NCA>Say you're confident.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_003: <NCB>Admit your doubts.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_004: <ACA>Me too! I've been doing some weapon maintenance...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_005: <ACA>I've been eating plenty to prepare for the match. And\nI've even been borrowing books from Tialla to study!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_006: <ACB>Really? That's not like you at all.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_007: *yawn*
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_008: I think all that preparing has made me sleepy.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01_009: I should add sleeping to my list of preparations.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c12_Pet_m01: <BLN>The final is coming up...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_001: Cai, I want to thank you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_002: For lots of stuff, not just the whole Zenzele thing.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_003: I've learned a lot fighting alongside you guys.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_004: And you've done a tremendous job raising\nAurora's spirits!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_005: It's kind of like fate that we met.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_006: And, when we did, I admit I thought you were...\nWell, I thought you were just a kid.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01_007: But all that's changed now. I've got your back in\nthe final. We'll win, whatever it takes!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c12_Hur_m01: <BLN>Thank you...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_001: The finals at last, eh, Cai? And against the\nWhite-Maned Demon no less.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_002: I admit I didn't think you had it in you to make it\nall the way to the top.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_003: I'm kidding! You're my boy and I am so damn\nproud of you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_004: I saw you deal with those bandits, by the way.\nI haven't seen you fight in a bit and...wow.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_005: We're apart for just a little while, and when I see you\nagain you've grown into a formidable fighter.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_006: I'm not sure if you take after me or your mother\nmore, but I'm happy to see it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_007: You've got a ways to go, but you're only going to keep\ngetting stronger. You're already better than me.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_008: Alright, get out of here. Go wherever you can go.\nWherever your heart takes you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_009: Aim for the heights I couldn't reach, and see the\nvistas that I never will.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01_010: There's no need for you to feel tied down by me now,\nyou understand?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c12_Cas_m01: <BLN>I am so damn proud.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_001: I have known about Castor's illness for quite some\ntime now.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_002: But, at his...quite firm request, I kept the truth\nconcealed from you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_003: You've grown into a fine young man, Cai. Castor has\ntold me he carries no regrets.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_004: ...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_005: Among those who serve the temple, I have a bit of a\nreputation as being...inflexible.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_006: I am not skilled in socializing. Those I can call\nfriends are few.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_007: Castor is the only person I feel comfortable calling a\nclose friend.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_008: I just want you to know that this is all painful.\nEven for Corundum...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_009: I am why Castor is prisoner. I am why he has a\ndeath sentence.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01_010: And now I... *sigh*
MID_LGA_1KAI_c12_Cen_m01: <BLN>About Castor's illness...